  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNJP - Laws, Policies and Sector to end FGM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UNJP - Laws, Policies and Sector to end FGM is a component of Supporting the Africa-led Movement to End Female Genital Mutilation (FGM): Phase II  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,460,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Human rights, Health education, Reproductive health care, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Ending violence against women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
